  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1102.16 Daytime telephone number",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1102.16 “Daytime telephone number” means the 10-digit telephone number at which the holder of the number can be reached during normal business hours.\n\nSource. #13198, eff 5-1-22 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100)",
